## Model orchestration

For substantial or risky multi-model work, use the `model-orchestration` skill when available. Otherwise act directly as a leaf: plan, implement, validate, and report in this session.

- Prefer intelligence over taste over cost for anything that ships.
- Quota fallback is fine when a lane is blocked: substitute openly and say so. Stop if I required that lane specifically or no substitute fits.
- GLM is text-only: never send it images; summarize visuals in text first.
- When running as a leaf under another orchestrator, skip re-delegation; the parent owns planning and review.
